[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4141.359, "timestamp": "01:09:01", "text": "会处理这件事的。 我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4142.239, "timestamp": "01:09:02", "text": "我的天啊。 你的基地遭到袭击。 什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4143.92, "timestamp": "01:09:03", "text": "你的基地遭到袭击。 什么？ 不，不，不，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4157.749, "timestamp": "01:09:17", "text": "是什么？ 我以为我做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4163.749, "timestamp": "01:09:23", "text": "我做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4166.229, "timestamp": "01:09:26", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4169.269, "timestamp": "01:09:29", "text": "我曾是通缉犯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4172.789, "timestamp": "01:09:32", "text": "我的天啊。 你做了什么？ 我打人了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4174.55, "timestamp": "01:09:34", "text": "。 哇。  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4177.99, "timestamp": "01:09:37", "text": "我感觉自己像是在玩……嗯，该怎么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4180.309, "timestamp": "01:09:40", "text": "称呼它呢？   现在就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4183.349, "timestamp": "01:09:43", "text": "Elder Ring。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4185.11, "timestamp": "01:09:45", "text": "哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4185.749, "timestamp": "01:09:45", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4188.149, "timestamp": "01:09:48", "text": "躲闪。 躲闪。 帕蒂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4189.829, "timestamp": "01:09:49", "text": "哦。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4196.03, "timestamp": "01:09:56", "author": "@Ghewar_Ji_ka_No-1FAN", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/CqrtcQvHFvr33XJk7uI96qZ5HyIAEb1ifU1jdPzM7vetPMlUZ4oYhF9BjVOj5xYYbkMi18Zfvg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4196.39, "timestamp": "01:09:56", "text": "走吧。 盾牌。 我们需要找到"}]